StripeBreadth 240k
Node CvfsDisk12 2 
Node CvfsDisk13 3 


[StripeGroup RegularFiles]  
Status UP
Exclusive No		##Non-Exclusive StripeGroup for all Files##
Read Enabled 
Write Enabled 
Alloc Enabled
StripeBreadth 256K
MultiPathMethod Rotate 
Node CvfsDisk14 0 
Node CvfsDisk15 1 
Node CvfsDisk16 2 
Node CvfsDisk17 3 

